# Third-party licenses

`lwk` (lanework-kit) is MIT-licensed. It is built from the crates below,
resolved from `Cargo.lock` for every target. Regenerate this file with:

    cargo about generate about.hbs > THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md

A crate under several licenses (`A AND B`) has one row for each.

